; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - best trailing of M3: Candles trailing (TrailMode 6), setup 3 of 3: buy, session 0700-1200 server time, trend filter none, target 2R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Trailing: stop beyond the low / high of the last 5 closed M3 candles, from the minute after entry. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 6, TrailParam 5).
; Same setup as Loma_T15_BTC_M3_Candles_3of3_Buy_0700-1200_NoFilter in Loma_BTCUSD_v1_35.zip (only the magic number differs): run one or the other, not both.
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (10 USD spread; score 1.31): 191 trades, PF 1.57. Replay of the same months: 191 trades, PF 1.44.
; REPLAY ON BINANCE BTCUSDT ONE-SECOND PRICES (four price points per second; the EA's rules; 10 USD spread, no commission). May 16 - Nov 13 2026 (the trailing was chosen on these months): this setup 63 trades, PF 1.67, net +10.3R (stressed PF 1.25); the 3 setups of M3 + Candles together 140 trades, PF 1.41, net +16.2R (stressed 1.08).
; Candles was chosen as the best of the EA's trailing systems on M3 (highest PF of those with 100+ trades in those months), so the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test.
; EARLIER DATA, not used for any choice (same replay and costs): this setup: 2024, 152 trades, PF 0.68; 2023 (from Jan 15), 146 trades, PF 0.68. The 3 setups together: 2024, 271 trades, PF 0.82; 2023 (from Jan 15), 242 trades, PF 0.84. They did not hold (under 1.3): UNPROVEN, Strategy Tester and demo only.
; Data: Binance BTCUSDT, broker server time. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter is on: on demo or live the EA skips entries within 30 minutes of high-impact USD news, which the replay did not do (no effect in the Strategy Tester). Set it to false to trade exactly what was replayed.
